      "normalizedSource": "If you set this property’s value to `1.0`, this temporal scaler expects that each pixel’s motion vector points to that pixel’s location in the [`colorTexture`](mtlfxtemporalscalerbase/colortexture.md) at the time of the last call to encode this scaler’s work.",
      "sourceHash": "b0e63db411db4018e905ac918827e0907e63c8ca3e86e87910294fd31a347cdc",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "The scaler converts the horizontal component of each value in [`motionTexture`](mtlfxtemporalscalerbase/motiontexture.md) into fragment (pixel) coordinates by multiplying it by this property’s value.",
